WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:04.721
This query partitions website visits by user and
orders them by visit time and visit

00:00:04.747 --> 00:00:11.935
ID LEAD retrieves the next visit timestamp
Subtracting

00:00:11.961 --> 00:00:17.638
the current timestamp gives time to the next visit
The last visit in each

00:00:17.665 --> 00:00:21.033
user sequence has no next row so LEAD returns NULL
